# Wave W17-L (Route 104): bed elm — a flower-road elm in full round crown, deeper warm greens than the first road’s young elm, a few bloom flecks caught in its skirts, on bed turf (ground baked in). The mature elm of the pair — Route 101’s is the sapling register.
